## Companion Documents (MUST update on every change)

Every article change MUST be accompanied by updates to these companion documents:

| Document | Update When | What to Update |
|----------|-------------|----------------|
| `SUMMARY.md` | Articles added, removed, or renamed | Add/remove/rename the entry |
| `ARTICLE_TAXONOMY.md` | Articles added or type changed | Add/update the mapping row |
| `SCREENSHOT_TRACKING.md` | Screenshots added or needed | Update status for the article |
| `Intain Markets – *.xlsx` | **Any article change** | Update Changes column + Description |
| `README.md` | Major structural changes | Update if Getting Started links change |
| `85_New_features.md` | New platform features documented | Add feature with date and description |
| `87_Retired_flows.md` | Features deprecated | Add retired flow with context |

### Excel Spreadsheet — Changes Column Convention

The Excel file (`Intain Markets – Knowledge Base Categories & Sub-Categories.xlsx`) has a **Changes** column that tracks what happened to each article in the current release. Use these tags:

| Tag | When to Use | Example |
|-----|-------------|---------|
| `Created — <description>` | Brand-new article | `Created — New article for Asset Sale settlement mechanics` |
| `Modified — <description>` | Existing article updated | `Modified — Added Entra SSO login flow, updated sidebar navigation` |
| `Renamed — <old name> → <new name>` | Article title/file changed | `Renamed — 38_Deal_Setup.md → 51_Deal_Setup_and_Calculations.md` |
| `Deleted — <reason>` | Article removed | `Deleted — Merged into article 36 (Settlement)` |
| `Unchanged` | No changes this release | `Unchanged` |

**Color coding** (when editing via script):
- 🟢 Green background (`#E2EFDA`) — Created
- 🟡 Yellow background (`#FFF2CC`) — Modified
- 🔵 Blue background (`#D6E4F0`) — Renamed
- ⚪ White background — Unchanged

