## Quality Gates (Before Publishing)

- [ ] Follows assigned Document Type structure
- [ ] 500+ words (600+ for process docs)
- [ ] Frontmatter complete (title + description)
- [ ] Screenshots for process/navigation articles
- [ ] All image paths resolve correctly
- [ ] No TODO/TBD/placeholder text
- [ ] Cross-references link to correct articles
- [ ] Specific field names and statuses from codebase
- [ ] SUMMARY.md entry exists
- [ ] ARTICLE_TAXONOMY.md entry exists
- [ ] Excel spreadsheet updated (Changes column + Description)
- [ ] SCREENSHOT_TRACKING.md updated if screenshots changed
